{"kind":"assert","text":"OB-L scope: run the same scratch adapter once against dap-grow, version 25e3ae1a, over one 15-minute window. It writes the same artroom_metrics_v1 dataset, and the Grow simulator drives it at about 25 to 30 Durable Object requests per minute, so the window should exceed 100 weighted routes. Use the same read-only rules and the same redaction check. Record the result beside the Demo no-data result in the same notes. Do not replace the Demo record. If Grow has 100 or more weighted routes, propose the first route p95 bound from it, labelled observed on Grow. If it also returns no-data, report that the route events may not be emitted at all, and stop. That would be a source question, not a calibration.\n\nLanding order: the OB-L notes head lands after E5. Rebase it onto published main once E5 is published, run its notes-only gate there, and then request the notes-only review.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}